@template earnest
// ZW1 (writer), patch 0.92.3 item 26: crew comment when you wear dirty clothes. clothes.remark: yesterday's clothes
// (flag:clothes.stale); clothes.grubby: a grubby uniform (flag:clothes.grubby, AC3). Bubbles, 60 characters or fewer.
// Kind, never mean: the joke is on the clothes, not on you.
== clothes.remark
? flag:clothes.stale
- I think that's yesterday's shirt? Sorry. Just saying.
- I wore mine twice once. Nobody minded. Much.   #funny
? flag:clothes.stale tier>=friend
- If you're short of clean ones, the laundry's easy. Honest.   #warm
== clothes.grubby
? flag:clothes.grubby
- Oh, you've got grime on you. Quite a lot, actually.
- Hard job? It looks like a hard job. On your sleeves.   #funny
? flag:clothes.grubby tier>=friend
- You should change. Not that you look bad. Just oily.   #warm
